  "body": "* Spacious single-level home with 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a double internal-access garage\r\n* Approx. 206sqm floor area on a generous 651sqm freehold section\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and family living area designed for easy everyday living\r\n* Separate living room positioned near the entrance, offering flexibility for relaxing or entertaining\r\n* Well-appointed master bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Expansive covered deck extending the living space outdoors, ideal for entertaining and relaxed family gatherings\r\n* Located within the Silverdale School and Orewa College zones\r\n\r\nStep inside and you'll find a home that balances generous proportions with an easy, practical layout. The heart of the home is the open-plan kitchen, dining and family area, where the contemporary kitchen with a central island connects naturally with the main living space and opens out to the expansive covered deck.\r\n\r\nDesigned for year-round enjoyment, the deck creates an inviting extension of the home, providing plenty of room for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply unwinding with the family.\r\n\r\nA separate living room sits just off the entrance, creating a quieter space away from the main living area and adding flexibility for different stages of family life.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is privately positioned with the added comfort of a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while three further bedrooms are well supported by the main bathroom, complete with a bathtub.\r\n\r\nWith excellent storage, a practical single-level layout and a double internal-access garage, this is a home designed around comfort and convenience. Set on approximately 651sqm of freehold land, it offers a well-rounded opportunity in a popular Millwater setting.\r\n\r\nSpend sunny days at beautiful Red Beach or Orewa, explore the nearby coastline, or enjoy the shopping and cafés of Silverdale and Orewa. \r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
